  "id": "blackberry-tiramisu-with-chocolate-sauce",
  "name": "Blackberry Tiramisu with Chocolate Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Coffee-soaked sponge, mascarpone cream, and fresh berries",
  "description": "A fruit-forward Italian dessert layered with Marsala coffee-soaked sponge fingers, vanilla mascarpone cream, blackberries, and chocolate sauce.",
